---
import BaseLayout from '@kedoupi/shared/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="关于这个空间"
  description="我是 kedoupi（codepi）。这里是我的个人数字化中心，把真实的生活留给自己，把专属的智能带给未来。"
  pathname="/about/"
  schemaType="WebPage"
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <header class="about-header">
      <span class="about-eyebrow">03 / 空间理念与原点</span>
      <h1 class="about-title">把自己的数据，<br /><em>交给自己的 AI。</em></h1>
      <p class="about-lead">
        我是 kedoupi（codepi）。这里是我的个人数字化中心，也是我为自己构建的私域智能起点。生活、投资、写作与思考，在这里慢慢连接。
      </p>
      <div class="about-tags" aria-label="核心属性">
        <span class="about-tag">私域数据主权</span>
        <span class="about-tag">真实生活切片</span>
        <span class="about-tag">SSO 统一鉴权</span>
        <span class="about-tag">向未知生长</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 核心哲学 Statement -->
    <section class="about-manifesto" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title">
      <div class="manifesto-content">
        <span class="manifesto-label">核心哲学</span>
        <h2 id="manifesto-title" class="manifesto-title">不拥有你，<br /><em>才有资格</em>理解你。</h2>
        <p class="manifesto-desc">
          数字化生活不应该是一场向公共平台交出隐私的妥协。我们创造的生活轨迹，理应成为我们自己的记忆与力量。把真实的生活留给自己，让智能在严密的尊重与授权中慢慢学会靠近。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 三大生活脉络 Bento Grid -->
    <section class="about-pillars" aria-labelledby="pillars-title">
      <div class="pillars-head">
        <span class="section-label">三条生活脉络</span>
        <h2 id="pillars-title" class="section-title">围绕真实生活，持续沉淀</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="pillars-grid">
        <article class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-badge">
            <span class="pillar-num">01</span>
            <span class="pillar-tag">生活 · HEALTH</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pillar-name">晨起与夜幕的真实节律</h3>
          <p class="pillar-desc">
            从 Oura 的日常记录出发，关注睡眠质量、静息心率与恢复指标。身体是所有行动的底色，看清自己的精力周期，比盲目加速更有力量。
          </p>
          <a class="pillar-link" href="/apps/#health">查看健康空间 ↗</a>
        </article>

        <article class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-badge">
            <span class="pillar-num">02</span>
            <span class="pillar-tag">投资 · GU</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pillar-name">每一笔判断的诚实复盘</h3>
          <p class="pillar-desc">
            投资不是一时的胜负博弈，而是一生认知的变现。把持仓、研究和决策逻辑完整保留下来，在市场的周期震荡中检验认知与执行。
          </p>
          <a class="pillar-link" href="/apps/#gu">查看投资工作台 ↗</a>
        </article>

        <article class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-badge">
            <span class="pillar-num">03</span>
            <span class="pillar-tag">记忆 · ME & GZH</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="pillar-name">经过确认的个人背景与叙事</h3>
          <p class="pillar-desc">
            来自日常的想法、偏好与稿件，先进入待确认区；经过确认后，成为本人可管理、可授权的个人背景，绝不被公共大模型随意幻觉编造。
          </p>
          <a class="pillar-link" href="/apps/#me">查看个人与表达 ↗</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 架构与权限边界 -->
    <section class="about-architecture" aria-labelledby="arch-title">
      <div class="arch-head">
        <span class="section-label">边界与安全</span>
        <h2 id="arch-title" class="section-title">开放与私密的清晰边界</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">
          公开的信息坦诚分享，私人的数据严格留给自己。这是智能可以安全接入的前提。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-grid">
        <div class="arch-box arch-box--public">
          <div class="arch-box-header">
            <span class="arch-pill">公开层 · Public</span>
            <h3>开放的思考与规范</h3>
          </div>
          <ul class="arch-list">
            <li>博客文章、思考复盘与项目介绍全量公开。</li>
            <li>通过 CodePi MCP 协议向外部 AI 客户端提供结构化只读索引。</li>
            <li>不包含任何个人敏感生理指标或未公开财务数据。</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="arch-box arch-box--private">
          <div class="arch-box-header">
            <span class="arch-pill arch-pill--accent">私域层 · Private</span>
            <h3>严密的个人工作空间</h3>
          </div>
          <ul class="arch-list">
            <li>健康记录、真实持仓、未发布稿件仅本人可见。</li>
            <li>基于独立 SSO 统一登录，会话独立鉴权并支持随时撤回。</li>
            <li>绝不将私人数据提供给第三方用于公共模型训练。</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 结尾与联系 -->
    <section class="about-cta" aria-labelledby="connect-title">
      <div class="about-cta-inner">
        <span class="section-label">交流与反馈</span>
        <h2 id="connect-title" class="cta-title">在开放中保持克制</h2>
        <p class="cta-desc">
          如果你对个人数字化空间、私域智能或这里的应用与设计理念感兴趣，欢迎通过公开渠道交流。
        </p>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a class="kdp-button" href="/apps/">看看正在使用的应用 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="kdp-button kdp-button--secondary" href="/contact/">联系与交流方式</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 56px;
  }
  .about-header {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .about-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--brand-orange-interactive);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .about-title {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.4vw, 50px);
    line-height: 1.16;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .about-title em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--brand-orange);
  }
  .about-lead {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .about-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .about-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(45, 42, 40, 0.02);
  }

  /* 核心宣言横幅 */
  .about-manifesto {
    padding: 44px 44px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2D2A28 0%, #1F1D1C 100%);
    color: #FAF8F4;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(45, 42, 40, 0.12);
  }
  .manifesto-content {
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .manifesto-label {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--brand-orange);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .manifesto-title {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.2vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #FAF8F4;
  }
  .manifesto-title em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--brand-orange);
  }
  .manifesto-desc {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #D3CEC6;
  }

  /* 三大支柱 */
  .section-label {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--brand-orange-interactive);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .section-title {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 32px);
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .section-desc {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .pillar-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 32px 28px 24px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(45, 42, 40, 0.02), 0 12px 32px rgba(45, 42, 40, 0.03);
    transition: transform var(--motion-normal) cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
                border-color var(--motion-normal) ease;
  }
  .pillar-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: rgba(255, 113, 61, 0.4);
  }
  .pillar-badge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .pillar-num {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brand-orange);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .pillar-tag {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .pillar-name {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .pillar-desc {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    flex: 1 1 auto;
  }
  .pillar-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--brand-orange-interactive);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--motion-normal) ease;
  }
  .pillar-link:hover {
    color: var(--brand-orange-hover);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* 架构与权限边界 */
  .arch-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .arch-box {
    padding: 32px 30px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(45, 42, 40, 0.02), 0 12px 32px rgba(45, 42, 40, 0.03);
  }
  .arch-box--private {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-surface) 0%, rgba(255, 230, 217, 0.25) 100%);
    border-color: rgba(255, 113, 61, 0.3);
  }
  .arch-box-header {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .arch-pill {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    background: rgba(45, 42, 40, 0.05);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .arch-pill--accent {
    color: var(--brand-orange-interactive);
    background: var(--brand-soft);
  }
  .arch-box h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 650;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .arch-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
    list-style: disc;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .arch-list li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  /* 结尾 CTA */
  .about-cta {
    padding: 44px 40px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(45, 42, 40, 0.03);
  }
  .about-cta-inner {
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .cta-title {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 650;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .cta-desc {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .pillars-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .arch-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .about-page {
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .about-manifesto {
      padding: 30px 22px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }
    .about-cta {
      padding: 30px 22px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }
    .cta-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .cta-actions .kdp-button {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .pillar-card {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
